ch-merz-accuses-north-korea-of-threatening-europe-s-freedom/live-79792915?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Friedrich Merz, who is visiting Seoul, said North Korea is putting Europe's security at risk by sending soldiers to fight for Russia in Ukraine. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>European Central Bank (ECB) head Christine Lagarde to step down in February, before her term ends</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7cc998da601e0b7951ea464a790ef8870d9b6e49ab40cb61e9f14ba2ce778c3e</id><updated>2026-10-29T15:19:52Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T10:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/european-central-bank-ecb-head-christine-lagarde-to-step-down-in-february-before-her-term-ends/a-79794353--c27511a3878b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/european-central-bank-ecb-head-christine-lagarde-to-step-down-in-february-before-her-term-ends/a-79794353?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">European Central Bank (ECB) President Christine Lagarde is to resign nine months ahead of the end of her 8-year term. European Council President Antonio Costa has said the process to find a successor is underway.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ship reported on fire off Oman as Iran escalation fears mount</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:877a41d19738c2ec32d6fd98e32cc0cd3b9b309b6d35a514e48671147c025cb9</id><updated>2026-10-29T15:19:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T10:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ship-reported-on-fire-off-oman-as-iran-escalation-fears-mount/a-79792733--778ab60c5f97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ship-reported-on-fire-off-oman-as-iran-escalation-fears-mount/a-79792733?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A ship in the Strait of Hormuz is reported to be on fire, a British maritime agency says. Iran has meanwhile said it has shot down another US drone as military tensions with Washington continue.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Bayern Munich head coach Vincent Kompany's health scare highlights the need for better support for elite coaches</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:708dd9baa45214f5591017f66d4a5e6a5a5298cc4ec6f43b4d79a9e5a8b4941c</id><updated>2026-10-29T15:19:58Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T07:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-head-coach-vincent-kompany-s-health-scare-highlights-the-need-for-better-support-for-e/a-79764661--fcbaed2aac2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-head-coach-vincent-kompany-s-health-scare-highlights-the-need-for-better-support-for-elite-coaches/a-79764661?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Vincent Kompany’s health concern is a reminder that elite football's pressures affect coaches too. Better support, clearer structures and mental health safeguards are increasingly vital.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Spain train crash: PM Sanchez calls for investigation as 3 days of mourning begins</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ec195b165add8f1709fcdb84f3ef19577b4f412e4d50eba246c56d304d5fad0e</id><updated>2026-10-29T15:20:04Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T07:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-train-crash-pm-sanchez-calls-for-investigation-as-3-days-of-mourning-begins/a-79792085--6fee42a979e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-train-crash-pm-sanchez-calls-for-investigation-as-3-days-of-mourning-begins/a-79792085?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Emergency crews worked through the night after a high-speed train collision killed 68 people. PM Pedro Sanchez has pledged a full investigation into Spain's second major train accident this year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ind